Eigen headers are vendored in tmol/extern/Eigen in the TMol source repository.
They are primarily MPL-2.0, with individual permissive third-party notices.
The complete vendored COPYING.* set is retained in licenses/Eigen, including
COPYING.README describing the optional LGPL portions of the source tree.
Shipping those license texts does not mean those optional portions are compiled.
Corresponding source: https://github.com/RosettaCommons/tmol/tree/master/tmol/extern/Eigen
